1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:00,780
…Board vote?

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:06,535
My dad's. Family business. He makes me
vote on stuff.

3
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:09,901
Your dad has a lot of departments.

4
00:00:10,021 --> 00:00:10,833
He really does.

5
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:14,986
<i>That's not a lie. That's a lie wearing
a hat.</i>

6
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:19,622
<i>Nine a.m. Grant's already counted the
votes.</i>

7
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:24,066
<i>Float spa. Kayaks. Pottery.</i>

8
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:26,426
<i>So this is where she finds everything.</i>

9
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:28,550
Forty-five.

10
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:32,726
<i>My first one. Don't tell anyone.</i>

11
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:42,193
You two the Groupon booking? Seven and
eight.

12
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:44,276
Oh, you're dead.

13
00:00:44,396 --> 00:00:45,237
Accident!

14
00:00:45,357 --> 00:00:46,249
So's this!

15
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,963
Dumbest thing you ever spent money on.
Go.

16
00:00:51,083 --> 00:00:52,184
Uh— you first.

17
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:56,103
<i>A jet. Do not say a jet.</i>

18
00:00:56,900 --> 00:01:00,963
Four hundred bucks. Concert. Left
after three songs. You?

19
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:04,740
…Bought a whole set of pans once.
Never opened 'em.

20
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:07,126
That's so sad.

21
00:01:07,246 --> 00:01:09,292
I opened them. Last week.

22
00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:15,408
<i>He made Lupe's tamales. Alone. I'm in
trouble.</i>

23
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:19,074
Your dad's jar. Lisbon. How full?

24
00:01:19,650 --> 00:01:25,634
A literal jar. Half-ish. I'm taking
him. For my abuela.

25
00:01:26,150 --> 00:01:28,332
She never got to go. So he will.

26
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:32,831
What if somebody just… covered it?

27
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,529
Then it'd be their trip.

28
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,045
I want it to be mine.

29
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:45,219
<i>Okay. No list. No signature. Whatever
it costs me.</i>

30
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:49,051
<i>Kiss the project, Reyes.</i>

31
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:55,333
<i>Please don't be who I think.</i>

32
00:01:58,900 --> 00:02:00,391
<i>No. Way.</i>

33
00:02:01,900 --> 00:02:04,390
Hunter Cole. In a rental kayak. Does
your board know?
